= Karl Schiller

Schiller is an economist and part of the <span style="color: #de6a70;">pragmatist</span> faction. As a supporter of social market economics, he is popular among the middle class.

- @economy_ministry_
- @white_collar
- @self_employed
- @root: Return to main

@economy_ministry_
title: Economic Policy
subtitle: As Minister of Economy, Schiller can enact new economic policies.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if spd_in_government = 0 : SPD not in government: ?] [? if economic_minister_party != "SPD" : The SPD does not control the ministry of economy. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and spd_in_government == 1 and economic_minister_party == "SPD"
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; economic_policy_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: economic_policy

@white_collar
